I will never forget how burning the tears of this world can be.

293
00:22:07,040 --> 00:22:12,440
Don’t be afraid of gains and losses or the ups and downs of life.

294
00:22:12,520 --> 00:22:17,960
When one has lived through the trials and tribulations of an ordinary life,

295
00:22:18,640 --> 00:22:24,080
their heart remains unburdened as they look back on the passing years.

296
00:22:24,560 --> 00:22:30,000
Looking back, the cycle of karma has always been there.

297
00:22:30,040 --> 00:22:35,480
May you never be consumed by grudges and resentment in this life.

298
00:22:31,760 --> 00:22:32,550
Take care,

299
00:22:33,640 --> 00:22:34,430
Father.

300
00:22:36,800 --> 00:22:41,720
I know you've seen all the world has to offer,

301
00:22:39,000 --> 00:22:41,190
Spend a lifetime with Ping'er

302
00:22:41,720 --> 00:22:50,320
but you’re still a child in my eyes.

303
00:22:44,320 --> 00:22:46,110
and I'll give you Nascent Soul cultivation.

304
00:22:46,880 --> 00:22:47,710
Are you willing ?

305
00:22:52,760 --> 00:22:54,150
But I truly cannot understand

306
00:22:54,800 --> 00:22:56,430
why Father refuses to let me cultivate !

307
00:22:56,440 --> 00:22:57,590
I told you,

308
00:22:58,120 --> 00:22:59,350
you're not suited for it.

309
00:23:01,720 --> 00:23:03,270
That girl named Qing Yi

310
00:23:07,240 --> 00:23:08,590
seems like a good person.

311
00:23:10,400 --> 00:23:11,470
I don’t need you

312
00:23:13,240 --> 00:23:15,030
to discipline my son.

313
00:23:15,960 --> 00:23:18,560
Everything in this world

314
00:23:18,840 --> 00:23:21,560
is born homeless

315
00:23:21,760 --> 00:23:24,520
like the echoes of fate.

316
00:23:27,560 --> 00:23:30,280
But the scent of the locust tree

317
00:23:30,800 --> 00:23:33,480
brings back memories of home

318
00:23:33,480 --> 00:23:36,240
as if you were right by my side.

319
00:23:39,720 --> 00:23:44,960
Don’t ask me if it was fate or a trial, it will be impossible to forget.

320
00:23:44,890 --> 00:23:46,720
Sun
Tai's
Grave

321
00:23:45,960 --> 00:23:51,320
Don't ask me how long it will take for us to meet again.

322
00:23:47,160 --> 00:23:47,950
Dad,

323
00:23:48,840 --> 00:23:49,710
I will spend my life

324
00:23:50,360 --> 00:23:51,630
accompanying you.

325
00:23:52,400 --> 00:23:53,390
Even in death.

326
00:23:51,360 --> 00:23:56,800
How can our relation be measured
by the number of days and nights we spent together ?

327
00:23:57,440 --> 00:24:02,960
Let’s simply keep each other in our thoughts.

328
00:24:03,560 --> 00:24:08,920
Looking back at the past, I have come to see through it all.

329
00:24:09,720 --> 00:24:15,120
But upon my return, I still say I have no regrets for having poured out my heart.

330
00:24:15,920 --> 00:24:20,680
There’s no need to dwell on the past,

331
00:24:20,680 --> 00:24:29,200
it's enough that this memory remains in my heart for the rest of my life.

332
00:24:30,960 --> 00:24:32,390
Ping'er can't lie to Dad.

333
00:24:34,680 --> 00:24:36,230
I can't make Dad sad !

334
00:24:46,600 --> 00:24:47,390
Dad...

335
00:24:48,680 --> 00:24:50,430
The medicine is very bitter...

336
00:24:54,080 --> 00:24:55,190
Let dust return to dust,

337
00:24:54,760 --> 00:25:00,200
Looking back at the past, I have come to see through it all.

338
00:24:55,880 --> 00:24:57,110
let dirt return to dirt.

339
00:24:58,200 --> 00:25:00,070
Above the Life and Death reincarnation cycle

340
00:25:00,680 --> 00:25:03,070
lies the elusive karma.

341
00:25:00,920 --> 00:25:06,360
But upon my return, I still say I have no regrets for having poured out my heart.

342
00:25:05,480 --> 00:25:06,630
The resentment you bear,

343
00:25:07,040 --> 00:25:11,880
There’s no need to dwell on the past,

344
00:25:07,080 --> 00:25:08,270
born from bloodshed,

345
00:25:09,120 --> 00:25:11,190
must also be dissolved in the mortal world.

346
00:25:11,880 --> 00:25:20,440
it's enough that this memory remains in my heart for the rest of my life.

347
00:25:12,920 --> 00:25:13,550
This time,

348
00:25:14,440 --> 00:25:15,990
I will grant you a new life.

349
00:25:17,760 --> 00:25:19,190
Enter this world of human existence,

350
00:25:20,000 --> 00:25:21,710
to truly live

351
00:25:22,600 --> 00:25:23,870
the life you deserve.

352
00:25:55,200 --> 00:25:56,510
Above Life and Death

353
00:25:57,840 --> 00:25:58,630
there is...

354
00:26:00,360 --> 00:26:02,110
Karma.
